@startuml UC-30 Hide Comment on Own Blog Post - Sequence Diagram
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.11.2.10 UC-30 Hide Comment on Own Blog Post — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
participant ":BlogCommunityPage" as UI
participant ":BlogController" as CTL
participant ":BlogCommentService" as SVC
participant ":BlogCommentRepository" as CREPO
participant ":BlogPostRepository" as PREPO
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Hide comment" on another teacher's comment on their own post
activate UI
UI -->> Teacher : Show the hide confirmation dialog (MSG44)
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Hide comment" to confirm
UI ->> UI : hideComment()
UI ->> CTL : POST /api/blog-comments/{commentId}/hide
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : hideByPostAuthor(commentId)
activate SVC

SVC ->> CREPO : findById(commentId)
activate CREPO
CREPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM blog_comments WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> CREPO : row / none
deactivate DB
CREPO -->> SVC : BlogComment
deactivate CREPO

SVC ->> PREPO : findPublishedById(postId)
activate PREPO
PREPO ->> DB : SELECT * FROM blog_posts WHERE id = ? AND status = 'PUBLISHED'
activate DB
DB -->> PREPO : row / none
deactivate DB
PREPO -->> SVC : BlogPost
deactivate PREPO

alt the post or comment is unavailable, the comment is the teacher's own, or the teacher does not own the post
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / IllegalArgumentException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 400 / 403
  UI -->> Teacher : Show that hiding is not permitted and leave the comment visible

else the teacher owns the post and the comment belongs to another teacher
  SVC ->> CREPO : save(comment)
  activate CREPO
  CREPO ->> DB : UPDATE blog_comments SET hidden_at = ?, hidden_by = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> CREPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  CREPO -->> SVC : BlogComment
  deactivate CREPO
  SVC ->> SVC : soft-hide every direct reply of that root comment the same way
  SVC -->> CTL : void
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 204 No Content
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG45, reload the discussion without the hidden comment and its replies
end

deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
